hsn|n|One who collect customs; a toll gatherer. ; One who regularly or repeatedly makes purchases of a trader; a purchaser; a buyer. ; A person with whom a business house has dealings; as, the customers of a bank. ; A peculiar person; -- in an indefinite sense; as, a queer customer; an ugly customer. ; A lewd woman.	a:o4e,90,5~o4e,90,5	N:1vhw,79,9;21h4,66,20~21h4,66,20;1vhw,79,9
